TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Aa,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Artık tamamen iyiyim!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Seni endişelendirdiysem özür dilerim.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}İlaç{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} veren {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} gerçekten işe
